{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2021-10-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'BAKER HUGHES AND AUGURY ANNOUNCE ALLIANCE TO ADD MACHINE HEALTH CAPABILITY TO BAKER HUGHES ASSET PERFORMANCE PORTFOLIO', 'text': "HOUSTON & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BAKER HUGHES (NYSE:BKR) HAS ANNOUNCED AN INVESTMENT IN AND A MULTI-YEAR COMMERCIAL ALLIANCE WITH AUGURY, A MACHINE HEALTH SOLUTION PROVIDER, TO DELIVER AN EXPANDED SET OF ASSET PERFORMANCE CAPABILITIES, PROVIDING CONNECTED DATA, ANALYTICS AND INSIGHTS INTO ENERGY AND INDUSTRIAL ASSETS. THE ALLIANCE BUILDS ON BAKER HUGHES' EXISTING ASSET PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT (APM) CAPABILITIES AND DOMAIN EXPERTISE IN CRITICAL INDUSTRIAL ASSETS. THROUGH THE ALLIANCE, CUSTOME"}